---

### 1.2 Expanded API Endpoints

All endpoints require `Authorization: Bearer <API_KEY>` header and Business tier.

#### Content Generation
| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| `GET` | `/api/v1/tools` | List all tools |
| `POST` | `/api/v1/generate` | Generate content using any tool |

#### Workflows (User's Account)
| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| `GET` | `/api/v1/workflows` | List user's workflows |
| `POST` | `/api/v1/workflows/:id/run` | Execute a workflow |

#### Templates (User's Account)
| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| `GET` | `/api/v1/templates` | List user's templates |
| `POST` | `/api/v1/templates/:id/run` | Execute a template |

#### Brand Voices (User's Account)
| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| `GET` | `/api/v1/brand-voices` | List user's brand voices |

#### Models
| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| `GET` | `/api/v1/models` | List available AI models |

### Rate Limits (Based on Subscription)

| Tier | Requests/Minute | Requests/Day |
|------|-----------------|--------------|
| Starter | N/A (no API) | N/A |
| Professional | 50 | 5,000 |
| Business | 100 | 10,000 |
| Enterprise | 500 | Unlimited |

