## Part 2: Outrank SEO Features

### Features from Outrank.so
1. ✅ Automated keyword research (via SEMrush/Ahrefs API or free alternative)
2. ✅ 30-day content planning calendar
3. ✅ SEO-optimized article generation (already have)
4. ✅ One-click WordPress publishing (via Nango - already integrated)
5. ✅ AI-generated images (via DALL-E/Stability - already integrated)

### Integration Options for Keyword Research

| Service | Free Tier | API | Recommendation |
|---------|-----------|-----|----------------|
| **DataForSEO** | ❌ No free | ✅ Yes | Paid only |
| **SEMrush** | ❌ No free | ✅ Yes | $99+/month |
| **Keywords Everywhere** | ⚠️ Limited | ✅ Yes | $10 credits |
| **Google Search Console** | ✅ Free | ✅ Yes | Your own sites only |
| **Serper.dev** | ✅ 2,500 free | ✅ Yes | **RECOMMENDED** |
| **SerpAPI** | ✅ 100 free | ✅ Yes | Good alternative |

**Decision:** Use **Serper.dev** for keyword/SERP data (free tier, no card required).

### Files to Create

#### [NEW] [server/lib/serper.js](file:///Users/shahidhasan/createHalal/write-ai/write-verse-hub/server/lib/serper.js)
- Serper.dev API integration
- Keyword research endpoint
- SERP analysis

#### [NEW] [src/pages/content-planner/ContentPlanner.tsx](file:///Users/shahidhasan/createHalal/write-ai/write-verse-hub/src/pages/content-planner/ContentPlanner.tsx)
