## Part 3: Natural Write Mode (Humanizer)

### Concept
Add a toggle in the top navigation bar:
- **AI Write** (default) - Normal AI generation
- **Natural Write** - Passes through humanizer API (costs more credits)

### UI Location
Below top nav, alongside:
- Model selector (existing)
- Brand voice selector (existing)
- **NEW:** Natural Write toggle

### Integration Options for Humanizer API

| Service | Free Tier | API | No Card | Recommendation |
|---------|-----------|-----|---------|----------------|
| **Undetectable.ai** | 250 words | ✅ | ✅ | **RECOMMENDED** |
| **HumanizeAI.pro** | Unlimited | ❌ No API | ✅ | Web only |
| **HIX Bypass** | Trial | ✅ | ❌ | $4.99/mo |
| **TextPolish** | 1000 words/mo | ✅ | ✅ | Good alternative |

**Decision:** Use **Undetectable.ai** (has API, 250 free words to test, no card for trial).

### Credit Cost
- **AI Write:** 1 credit per generation
- **Natural Write:** 2 credits per generation (1 for AI + 1 for humanizer pass)

### Files to Create

#### [NEW] [server/lib/humanizer.js](file:///Users/shahidhasan/createHalal/write-ai/write-verse-hub/server/lib/humanizer.js)
- Undetectable.ai API integration
- Humanize text endpoint

#### [MODIFY] Top Navigation
- Add Natural Write toggle alongside model selector

#### [MODIFY] Generation Flow
- If Natural Write enabled, pass output through humanizer before returning

